# GoalStick Python Service

Python service for monitoring NHL games and triggering LED celebrations on a Raspberry Pi.

See the main [README](../README.md) for full documentation.

## Installation

```bash
pip install -e ".[dev]"
```

## Usage

```bash
python main.py --team WSH
```
